# Pairs with TenantLayerConfined: the caller's active tenant, not the tree owner, selects the tenant layer of a crossing request.

MODULE: ActiveTenantGoverns
TARGET: TenantLayerConfined
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the caller's active tenant, not the tree owner, selects the tenant layer of a crossing request

--- FIND
LayerTenant(c, tree) == tree.tenant
--- REPLACE
LayerTenant(c, tree) == ActiveTenant(c)
--- END
